WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:07.329
Scry Sync lives in your menu bar and keeps
one folder synced with a Scry project.

2
00:00:07.899 --> 00:00:13.271
Click its icon to see the project, the
folder, and a plain status line.

3
00:00:13.841 --> 00:00:19.532
Anything that needs attention is listed in
words, with one action per row.

4
00:00:20.102 --> 00:00:25.323
Pause stops syncing for a while, and the
gear opens Settings.
